@baseUrl = {{baseUrl}}

### Auth session status
# Expected: 200 OK with session payload or null session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session

### Auth CSRF token
# Expected: 200 OK with csrfToken
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/csrf

### Auth providers
# Expected: 200 OK with configured providers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/providers

### Protected session reuse example
# Replace the cookie value manually when you need to test a signed-in route.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session
Cookie: authjs.session-token=<paste-local-session-cookie>
